            <h2 class="section-title">🔥 Exclusive Deals Near You</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">Limited-time savings on certified home repairs, healthcare, and dining</p>
          </div>
          <button class="action-btn action-btn-outline" onclick="window.LocalCare.filterOffersOnly()">
